<title>UK: Citicorp sets 200 billion lire three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Citicorp sets 200 billion lire three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced on Tuesday by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Citibank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITICORP</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    06.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.95</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/GB/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
